# Scan-time artifacts. The IR is regenerated from source every run and is often
# hundreds of megabytes.
.ir.json
*.sarif
.sast-baseline.json

# Dependencies and caches
node_modules/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Go build and test output
*.test
*.out

# The raw CWE release: ~18MB, downloadable from cwe.mitre.org, and reproducible.
# What the build actually embeds is the generated cwe.json, which IS committed:
# without it the ledger cannot compile.
catalog/cwec_v*.xml

# Maintainer reports and the log of what was sent.
#
# A drafted report contains the full path to an unfixed weakness in somebody else's software,
# written to be readable. Publishing one is a disclosure, made by us on our schedule rather than
# the maintainer's, and it makes a nonsense of having reported it privately an hour earlier.
# This was learned by doing it: eight reports were committed to a public repository minutes
# after they were submitted through private channels.
#
# The template is tracked because it contains no findings. Nothing else here is.
loop/reports/*
!loop/reports/TEMPLATE.md
!loop/reports/README.md
